<section class="what-pactsol-does">
  <div class="site-container">

    <div class="what-pactsol-does__intro">

      <p class="what-pactsol-does__label">
        What PACTSOL Does
      </p>

      <h2>
  Structured sourcing support for selected industrial requirements.
</h2>

      <p>
        PACTSOL helps businesses organize selected sourcing requirements,
        identify suitable supply options, coordinate relevant quotations,
        and review the resulting commercial position before the customer
        decides how to proceed.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="what-pactsol-does__steps">

      <article class="what-pactsol-does__step">
        <span>01</span>

        <h3>
          You share the requirement.
        </h3>

        <p>
          Provide the product requirement, specification, quantity,
          delivery location, required timeline, and other relevant
          commercial information.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="what-pactsol-does__step">
        <span>02</span>

        <h3>
          PACTSOL reviews the requirement.
        </h3>

        <p>
          We review the information provided, identify any points requiring
          clarification, and determine whether the requirement falls within
          our current sourcing scope.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="what-pactsol-does__step">
        <span>03</span>

        <h3>
          Suitable supply options are coordinated.
        </h3>

        <p>
          Where appropriate, PACTSOL coordinates with relevant manufacturers,
          distributors, or suppliers to obtain available commercial options.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="what-pactsol-does__step">
        <span>04</span>

        <h3>
          You review and decide.
        </h3>

        <p>
          PACTSOL helps organize the available commercial information for
          review. The customer remains responsible for selecting the supplier,
          accepting the commercial terms, and making the final purchasing
          decision.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>




